            IBM Plex Sans provides clarity and readability.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Option 1 -->
        <div class="border border-color-200 rounded-lg p-6 sourceserif-headlines sourceserif-body">
          <p class="text-meta mb-4">Option 1: Source Serif Pro + IBM Plex Sans</p>
          <h3 class="heading-3 mb-2">Typography Design</h3>
          <p class="text-sm">
            Adobe's elegant serif paired with IBM's readable sans.
            Classic editorial style with modern clarity.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Option 2 -->
        <div class="border border-color-200 rounded-lg p-6 inter-headlines inter-body">
          <p class="text-meta mb-4">Option 2: Inter</p>
          <h3 class="heading-3 mb-2">Typography Design</h3>
          <p class="text-sm">
            Inter provides exceptional screen readability.
            Designed specifically for user interfaces.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Option 3 -->
        <div class="border border-color-200 rounded-lg p-6 crimson-headlines crimson-body">
          <p class="text-meta mb-4">Option 3: Crimson Pro</p>
          <h3 class="heading-3 mb-2">Typography Design</h3>
          <p class="text-sm">
            A sophisticated serif optimized for screens.
            Classic book typography meets digital clarity.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Option 4 -->
        <div class="border border-color-200 rounded-lg p-6 inter-plex-headlines plex-sans-body">
          <p class="text-meta mb-4">Option 4: Inter + IBM Plex Sans</p>
          <h3 class="heading-3 mb-2">Typography Design</h3>
          <p class="text-sm">
            Modern geometric headlines with technical sans body.
            Two highly readable sans-serif families.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Article Preview -->
    <section class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="heading-3 mb-8">Article Preview Comparison</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <!-- Current + Option 1 -->
        <div>
          <div class="border border-color-200 rounded-lg p-6 mb-6">
            <p class="text-meta mb-4">Current Design</p>
            <article>
              <h1 class="heading-2 mb-2">Understanding Modern Typography</h1>
              <p class="text-meta mb-3">January 23, 2025 • 5 min read</p>
              <p class="text-0">
                In the digital age, typography has evolved from a specialized craft to an essential 
                element of user experience design. The choices we make about typefaces, spacing, 
                and hierarchy directly impact how users perceive and interact with content.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>
          
          <div class="border border-color-200 rounded-lg p-6 sourceserif-headlines sourceserif-body">
            <p class="text-meta mb-4">With Source Serif Pro + IBM Plex Sans</p>
            <article>
              <h1 class="heading-2 mb-2">Understanding Modern Typography</h1>
              <p class="text-meta mb-3">January 23, 2025 • 5 min read</p>
              <p class="text-0">
                In the digital age, typography has evolved from a specialized craft to an essential 
