      <!-- Blog Post Layout -->
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h3 class="heading-4 mb-6">Blog Post Layout</h3>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <!-- Current -->
          <div class="p-6 border border-color-200 rounded-lg">
            <p class="text-meta mb-4">Current Design</p>
            <article class="prose max-w-none">
              <h1 class="heading-1">The Evolution of Industrial Policy</h1>
              <p class="text-meta mb-4">January 23, 2025 • Nathan Lane • 15 min read</p>
              <p class="text-lead">
                Industrial policy has undergone a remarkable transformation over the past decade, 
                shifting from a taboo subject to a mainstream policy tool.
              </p>
              <h2 class="heading-2 mt-8">Historical Context</h2>
              <p>
                The modern conception of industrial policy emerged in the postwar period, as nations 
                sought to rebuild their economies and establish competitive advantages in global markets.
              </p>
              <h3 class="heading-3 mt-6">Key Developments</h3>
