      <ol class="text-sm list-decimal ml-6 space-y-1">
        <li>Get Halyard from Adobe Fonts or Darden Studio</li>
        <li>Update your font configuration in tailwind.config.ts</li>
        <li>Replace Work Sans with Halyard Display for headlines</li>
        <li>Replace Inter with Halyard Text for body copy</li>
      </ol>
